        "original_id": "9639ba9d-6618-5563-ba39-159e82c91c18",
        "text": "Page: Tiffany Darwish. Sentence: Tiffany Renee Darwish (born October 2, 1971), also known as Tiffany, is an American singer, songwriter, actress, and former teen icon.\nPage: Tiffany Darwish. Sentence: The singles \"Could've Been\" and \"I Saw Him Standing There\", a cover version of The Beatles' \"I Saw Her Standing There\", followed soon after, with the former also claiming the number one position on the \"Billboard\" Hot 100.\nPage: I Saw Her Standing There. Sentence: It is the opening track on the band's 1963 debut album \"Please Please Me\".",
